{"id":"631646","name":"狼牙土豆","author":"李子生活漫记","authorId":"268590","desc":"","cover":"images/631646/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"折耳根","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小米辣","amount":"适量"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"土豆去皮洗净。","img":"images/631646/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"用波纹刀切成条。","img":"images/631646/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"清水冲洗几次，去除多余的淀粉。","img":"images/631646/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"冷水浸泡30分钟。","img":"images/631646/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"折耳根取嫩根儿洗净。","img":"images/631646/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"小葱，香菜切小段。","img":"images/631646/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"小米辣切小段。","img":"images/631646/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"折耳根剪成小段。","img":"images/631646/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"泡好的土豆条控干水。","img":"images/631646/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"入160度热油炸2分钟，注意时间不宜过长，否则会变软。","img":"images/631646/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"分别盛装在两个大碗里，准备做一碗辣一碗不辣。","img":"images/631646/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"两碗都加入精盐，细砂糖，花椒粉，孜然粉，其中一碗再加入辣椒粉和小米辣。","img":"images/631646/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"淋上刚炸完土豆的热油。","img":"images/631646/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"再加入折耳根，小葱，香菜小段。","img":"images/631646/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"淋上香醋，拌匀。","img":"images/631646/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"分装到小纸碗中。","img":"images/631646/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"用竹签扎着吃更对味儿。","img":"images/631646/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}